Then why did you say that, instead of something else.  As a
Barb, he can't get skilled in sabre or in dagger; he can only
get those two to basic.  Which doesn't mean that dagger isn't an
appropriate choice as a ranged weapon---it's about the best he
can do---, nor that a silver sabre wouldn't be appropriate
against silver hating monsters.

The whole point of nethack is that there isn't one right answer,
and you're always having to evaluate trade offs.

